#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:7
msgid ""
"This checklist is intended to serve as a guide to Enterprises who are "
"rolling out Mattermost to thousands of users."
msgstr "이 체크리스트는 수천 명의 사용자에게 OKR.BEST를 롤아웃하는 엔터프라이즈를 위한 가이드 역할을 하기 위한 것입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:10
msgid "Checklist overview"
msgstr "체크리스트 개요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:13
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:44
msgid "Prepare for the roll out"
msgstr "롤아웃 준비"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:15
msgid "`1. Define the roll out project`_"
msgstr "`1. 롤아웃 프로젝트 정의`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:16
msgid "`2. Validate essential security and compliance requirements`_"
msgstr "`2. 필수 보안 및 컴플라이언스 요구 사항 검증`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:17
msgid "`3. Create development, staging, and production environments`_"
msgstr "`3. 개발, 스테이징, 프로덕션 환경 생성`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:18
msgid "`4. Configure and customize your Mattermost site`_"
msgstr "`4. OKR.BEST 사이트 구성 및 사용자 정의`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:19
msgid "`5. Test production performance and redundancy`_"
msgstr "`5. 프로덕션 성능 및 중복성 테스트`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:22
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:222
msgid "Roll out Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 롤아웃"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:24
msgid "`1. Define your team and channel strategy`_"
msgstr "`1. 팀 및 채널 전략 정의`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:25
msgid "`2. Enable key integrations`_"
msgstr "`2. 핵심 통합 활성화`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:26
msgid "`3. Prepare for user onboarding`_"
msgstr "`3. 사용자 온보딩 준비`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:27
msgid "`4. Deploy client apps`_"
msgstr "`4. 클라이언트 앱 배포`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:28
msgid "`5. Roll out to groups of users`_"
msgstr "`5. 사용자 그룹에 롤아웃`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:29
msgid "`6. Drive adoption`_"
msgstr "`6. 도입 촉진`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:32
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:339
msgid "Review the roll out"
msgstr "롤아웃 검토"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:34
msgid "`1. Review project charter success metrics`_"
msgstr "`1. 프로젝트 차터 성공 지표 검토`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:35
msgid "`2. Review and analyze usage`_"
msgstr "`2. 사용량 검토 및 분석`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:36
msgid "`3. Analyze system performance`_"
msgstr "`3. 시스템 성능 분석`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:37
msgid "`4. Harden security`_"
msgstr "`4. 보안 강화`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:38
msgid "`5. Perform maintenance tasks`_"
msgstr "`5. 유지 관리 작업 수행`_"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:41
msgid "Checklist details"
msgstr "체크리스트 세부 정보"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:46
msgid ""
"Much of the preparation work is focused on ensuring the environment is "
"deployed and secured prior to onboarding users."
msgstr "준비 작업의 상당 부분은 사용자를 온보딩하기 전에 환경이 배포되고 보안이 확보되도록 하는 데 중점을 둡니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:49
msgid "1. Define the roll out project"
msgstr "1. 롤아웃 프로젝트 정의"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:51
msgid "Define key stakeholders and project team members"
msgstr "핵심 이해관계자와 프로젝트 팀 구성원을 정의합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:53
msgid ""
"Example project team members: Project Manager, Network Administrator, "
"Database Administrator, Corporate Directory Administrator, Security & "
"Compliance Administrator(s), User Support, User Champions, User Trainers"
msgstr "예시 프로젝트 팀 구성원: 프로젝트 관리자, 네트워크 관리자, 데이터베이스 관리자, 기업 디렉토리 관리자, 보안 및 컴플라이언스 관리자, 사용자 지원, 사용자 챔피언, 사용자 트레이너"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:55
msgid ""
"Define use cases and requirements for teams, their workflows and their "
"integrations"
msgstr "팀, 워크플로, 통합에 대한 사용 사례와 요구 사항을 정의합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:57
msgid ""
"Resource: https://mattermost.com/blog/27-things-enterprises-can-learn-"
"startups-increase-productivity/"
msgstr "리소스: https://mattermost.com/blog/27-things-enterprises-can-learn-startups-increase-productivity/"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:59
msgid "Define success criteria, goals and metrics to measure success"
msgstr "성공을 측정하기 위한 성공 기준, 목표, 지표를 정의합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:61
msgid ""
"Create a Project Charter to document goals, tasks, deliverables, and "
"decisions"
msgstr "목표, 작업, 산출물, 결정을 문서화하기 위한 프로젝트 차터를 생성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:63
msgid ""
"Get buy-in from project team members and key stakeholders on the project "
"charter"
msgstr "프로젝트 차터에 대해 프로젝트 팀 구성원과 핵심 이해관계자의 동의를 얻습니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:66
msgid "2. Validate essential security and compliance requirements"
msgstr "2. 필수 보안 및 컴플라이언스 요구 사항 검증"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:68
msgid "Review Mattermost security features"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 보안 기능을 검토합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:70
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/security-guide/security-guide-"
"index.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/security-guide/security-guide-index.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:72
msgid "Determine monitoring requirements"
msgstr "모니터링 요구 사항을 결정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:74
msgid "Database, network, storage, log integrity"
msgstr "데이터베이스, 네트워크, 저장소, 로그 무결성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:75
msgid ""
"Identify fields for log management tools (e.g. Splunk Enterprise event "
"data)"
msgstr "로그 관리 도구를 위한 필드를 식별합니다(예: Splunk Enterprise 이벤트 데이터)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:77
msgid "Determine environment access policies"
msgstr "환경 접근 정책을 결정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:79
msgid "Network access, physical access, group controlled access"
msgstr "네트워크 접근, 물리적 접근, 그룹 제어 접근"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:81
msgid "Determine encryption policies"
msgstr "암호화 정책을 결정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:83
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/encryption-"
"options.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/encryption-options.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:84
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/transport-"
"encryption.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/transport-encryption.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:86
msgid "Determine system administration access policies"
msgstr "시스템 관리 접근 정책을 결정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:88
msgid ""
"Identify the list of users or groups who need administrative access for "
"Mattermost System Console, Command Line Tools, and API privileges"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 관리자 도구, 명령줄 도구, API 권한에 대한 관리 접근이 필요한 사용자 또는 그룹 목록을 식별합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:90
msgid "Define and configure authentication policies"
msgstr "인증 정책을 정의하고 구성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:92
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/product-overview/corporate-"
"directory-integration.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/product-overview/corporate-directory-integration.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:94
msgid "Determine requirements for multi-factor authentication"
msgstr "다단계 인증 요구 사항을 결정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:96
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/multi-"
"factor-authentication.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:98
msgid ""
"Configure and test SSO or Corporate Directory integration (SAML or "
"AD/LDAP)"
msgstr "SSO 또는 기업 디렉토리 통합(SAML 또는 AD/LDAP)을 구성하고 테스트합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:100
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/sso-"
"saml.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:101
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/ad-"
"ldap.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:103
msgid "Define your mobile usage policy"
msgstr "모바일 사용 정책을 정의합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:105
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:290
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-"
"deployment.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:107
msgid "Evaluate external network access requirements"
msgstr "외부 네트워크 접근 요구 사항을 평가합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:109
msgid ""
"The `Mattermost Marketplace <https://mattermost.com/marketplace>`_ is a "
"service hosted by Mattermost that functions as a central place to store "
"the current versions of available Mattermost integrations.  See "
":ref:`Enable Remote Marketplace <administration-guide/configure/plugins-"
"configuration-settings:enable remote marketplace>` documentation for "
"details about required external network access."
msgstr "`Mattermost 마켓플레이스 <https://mattermost.com/marketplace>`_\ 는 사용 가능한 Mattermost 통합의 현재 버전을 저장하는 중앙 장소 역할을 하는 Mattermost 호스팅 서비스입니다. 필요한 외부 네트워크 접근에 관한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`원격 마켓플레이스 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings:enable remote marketplace>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:110
msgid ""
"Mattermost supports external GIF providers. See :ref:`GIF Commands "
"<administration-guide/configure/integrations-configuration-"
"settings:enable gif picker>` configuration documentation for details "
"about required external network access."
msgstr "OKR.BEST는 외부 GIF 공급자를 지원합니다. 필요한 외부 네트워크 접근에 관한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`GIF Commands <administration-guide/configure/integrations-configuration-settings:enable gif picker>` 구성 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:113
msgid "3. Create development, staging, and production environments"
msgstr "3. 개발, 스테이징, 프로덕션 환경 생성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:115
msgid ""
"Finalize production environment design basing hardware on expected usage "
"and requirements for high availability"
msgstr "예상 사용량과 고가용성 요구 사항을 기준으로 하드웨어를 정하여 프로덕션 환경 설계를 확정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:117
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:140
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/reference-"
"architecture/application-architecture.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/application-architecture.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:118
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-"
"index.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/deployment-guide-index.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:119
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/scale/scaling-"
"for-enterprise.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:120
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/scale/high-"
"availability-cluster-based-deployment.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:122
msgid "Create development and staging environments"
msgstr "개발 및 스테이징 환경을 생성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:124
msgid ""
"Recommend using to test early configurations for database, "
"authentication, file storage, Elasticsearch, prior to setting up high "
"availability and load balancing"
msgstr "고가용성과 로드 밸런싱을 설정하기 전에 데이터베이스, 인증, 파일 저장소, Elasticsearch의 초기 구성을 테스트하는 데 사용하는 것을 권장합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:125
msgid ""
"Recommend configuring staging to be an identical replication of your "
"production environment"
msgstr "스테이징을 프로덕션 환경과 동일하게 복제하도록 구성하는 것을 권장합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:127
msgid "Create a production environment"
msgstr "프로덕션 환경을 생성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:129
msgid "Install Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 설치합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:131
msgid ""
"Install the number of nodes based on your high availability requirements "
"outlined in your production environment design"
msgstr "프로덕션 환경 설계에 명시된 고가용성 요구 사항을 기준으로 노드 수를 설치합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:132
msgid ""
"Recommendation: Use Kubernetes and the Mattermost Operator, with external"
" supported external database and file storage solutions. This will also "
"provide blue/green deployment, rolling upgrades, and canary builds"
msgstr "권장 사항: Kubernetes와 Mattermost Operator를 지원되는 외부 데이터베이스 및 파일 저장소 솔루션과 함께 사용하세요. 이렇게 하면 블루/그린 배포, 롤링 업그레이드, 카나리 빌드도 제공됩니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:134
#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:204
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/server/deploy-"
"kubernetes.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:136
msgid "Install and configure database"
msgstr "데이터베이스를 설치하고 구성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:138
msgid ""
"Install the number of read and search replicas based on your high "
"availability requirements outlined in your production environment design"
msgstr "프로덕션 환경 설계에 명시된 고가용성 요구 사항을 기준으로 읽기 및 검색 복제본 수를 설치합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:142
msgid ""
"(Optional) Set up configuration management via the database instead of a "
"config file for high available environments"
msgstr "(선택 사항) 고가용성 환경을 위해 구성 파일 대신 데이터베이스를 통한 구성 관리를 설정합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:144
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/configure"
"/configuration-in-your-database.html"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/configure/configuration-in-your-database.html"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:146
msgid "Install and configure File Storage"
msgstr "파일 저장소를 설치하고 구성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:148
msgid ""
"Resource: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-"
"guide/server/preparations.html#file-storage-preparation"
msgstr "리소스: https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment-guide/server/preparations.html#file-storage-preparation"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:150
msgid "Install and configure proxy or load balancers"
msgstr "프록시 또는 로드 밸런서를 설치하고 구성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/enterprise-roll-out-checklist.rst:152
msgid ""
